postmail - send mail

usage: postmail [id]

    Recipient, subject, body. Ctrl-C aborts at any prompt.
    In the body you can move up with the arrows to fix earlier lines.
    Submit with a single line containing only "." .
    Set a signature with regsign.
    To share an external file, put a URL in the body (this system does not
    send or receive files).
    * That is a download from an outside site. Do not open files whose
      source you cannot verify.
